    "_why": {
      "off-colour": "the browserFrame block paints the real macOS traffic-light dots, and window chrome that is not those three colours does not read as window chrome",
      "clipped-text": "tabBar.switch reveals the selected label through a moving mask, so the pill's clientWidth (347px) is meant to be narrower than the label row inside it (1052px). Nothing is cut on screen: the audit reads a deliberate mask as a clipped glyph run."
